{"attributes":{"description":"SOC Lab – Anomaly Detection Dashboard\n\nFocuses on deviations from expected behaviour: unusual process relationships, non-standard outbound ports, off-hours authentication, and privilege escalation indicators.\n\nHow to use:\n  - Run over a 24-hour baseline first to understand normal patterns\n  - Process Parent-Child table: compare to your known-good baseline; unfamiliar pairs warrant investigation\n  - High-Port Outbound: any significant traffic on ports outside 80/443/53/22 is suspicious\n  - Auth by Hour: spikes in late-night/weekend hours may indicate automated attacks\n  - SYSTEM Processes metric: values above your baseline indicate potential privilege escalation\n\nImport instructions:\n  Kibana → Stack Management → Saved Objects → Import → select this file","hits":0,"kibanaSavedObjectMeta":{"searchSourceJSON":"{\"query\":{\"language\":\"kuery\",\"query\":\"\"},\"filter\":[]}"},"optionsJSON":"{\"useMargins\":true,\"syncColors\":false,\"hidePanelTitles\":false}","panelsJSON":"[{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"w\":24,\"h\":18,\"i\":\"panel-0\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-0\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_0\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":24,\"y\":0,\"w\":12,\"h\":18,\"i\":\"panel-1\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-1\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_1\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":36,\"y\":0,\"w\":12,\"h\":18,\"i\":\"panel-2\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-2\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_2\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":18,\"w\":48,\"h\":15,\"i\":\"panel-3\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-3\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_3\"}]","refreshInterval":{"pause":false,"value":30000},"timeFrom":"now-24h","timeTo":"now","timeResto